{"id":"wb-6-826","name":"栖云洞造像","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"栖云洞造像","text":"栖云洞造像陈列于福建省福州市罗源县城关南圣水寺栖云洞内，为十八罗汉石雕像，全国重点文物保护单位（第六批）。其中16尊系南宋淳祐八年（1248年）石匠陈曾缘刻，为福建省现存最早的石雕罗汉，另2尊属明代作品。此外，洞中还有一尊观音石雕。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A0%96%E4%BA%91%E6%B4%9E%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F","revisionId":86785856,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785856","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6c57fad7012fc40569564a5c.jpg","title":"栖云洞造像_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%A0%96%E4%BA%91%E6%B4%9E%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/%E6%A0%96%E4%BA%91%E6%B4%9E%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三岛春潮","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​栖云洞造像，位于福建省福州市罗源县凤山镇，全国重点文物保护单位","width":320,"height":239}}